          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="reveal mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase" style="color: #a7a39c;"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-bar"></span> get the theme </div>
          <h2 data-v-c47154f1="" class="reveal mb-2 font-mono leading-none font-bold" style="color: #e7e5e4;"> Fifteen ports </h2>
