        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="reveal flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/grimicorn-palette.md" download="" class="n-btn n-btn-ghost">palette.md</a><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/grimicorn-neon-themes.zip" download="" class="n-btn n-btn-rainbow" style="background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #FF2D9B, #FACC15, #A3E635, #22D3EE, #2323FF, #A855F7, #FF2D9B);"> download all (.zip) </a></div>
