          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3h12v10H3z"></path><path d="M5.5 6.5l2 2-2 2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9 10.5h3"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold" style="color: #e7e5e4;">Ghostty</span><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-badge">featured</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Terminal config — background, foreground, cursor &amp; the 16-color ANSI palette.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/ghostty/grimicorn-neon.conf" download="grimicorn-neon.conf" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]" style="color: #75726b;"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Drop it in <code>~/.config/ghostty/themes/</code> and set <code>theme = grimicorn-neon</code>, or include it with <code>config-file = …</code>.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://ghostty.org/docs/config/reference#theme" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5" style="border-color: #a855f7;">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="5" cy="5" r="1.6"></circle><circle cx="5" cy="13" r="1.6"></circle><circle cx="13" cy="9" r="1.6"></circle><path d="M5 6.6v4.8M6.5 5h4.4a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6 1.6V8"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold" style="color: #e7e5e4;">Git Tower</span><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-badge">featured</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Diff &amp; syntax theme for the Tower git client.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/gittower/Grimicorn-Neon.towertheme" download="Grimicorn Neon.towertheme" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]" style="color: #75726b;"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Double-click the <code>.towertheme</code> to install, then pick it in Tower → Settings → Git Config / Appearance.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://www.git-tower.com/help/guides/integration/syntax-highlighting/mac" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5" style="border-color: #a855f7;">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 2.5h7L14 6v9.5H4z"></path><path d="M11 2.5V6h3"></path><path d="M6.5 9h5M6.5 11.5h5"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold" style="color: #e7e5e4;">Obsidian</span><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-badge">featured</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Vault theme with the full neon heading-color waterfall.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/obsidian/theme.css" download="theme.css" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> theme.css</a><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/obsidian/manifest.json" download="manifest.json" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> manifest.json</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]" style="color: #75726b;"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Place both files in <code>.obsidian/themes/Grimicorn Neon/</code>, then Settings → Appearance → <em>Grimicorn Neon</em>.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://help.obsidian.md/themes" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
