        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5" style="border-color: #a855f7;">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3h12v10H3z"></path><path d="M5.5 6.5l2 2-2 2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9 10.5h3"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold" style="color: #e7e5e4;">Panic Prompt</span><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-badge">featured</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Panic's SSH client for Mac &amp; iOS — neon ANSI, cursor &amp; selection, with text glow switched on.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/prompt/Grimicorn-Neon.promptTheme" download="Grimicorn-Neon.promptTheme" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]" style="color: #75726b;"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Double-click the <code>.promptTheme</code> to import (or Settings → Themes → ⚙︎ → <em>Import</em>), then pick Grimicorn Neon from the theme list.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://help.panic.com/prompt/prompt-themes/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5" style="border-color: #a855f7;">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3h12v10H3z"></path><path d="M3 6h12"></path><path d="M5.5 4.5h.01"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold" style="color: #e7e5e4;">VS Code</span><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-badge">featured</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Full editor + workbench theme, glowing on near-black.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/vscode/grimicorn-neon.color-theme.json" download="grimicorn-neon.color-theme.json" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]" style="color: #75726b;"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Drop the file into a folder with a package.json under <code>~/.vscode/extensions/grimicorn-neon/</code>, reload, then pick Grimicorn Neon in <code>⌘K ⌘T</code>.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/configure/themes" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5" style="border-color: #1c1c20;">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3h12v10H3z"></path><path d="M3 6h12"></path><path d="M5.5 4.5h.01"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold" style="color: #e7e5e4;">Antigravity</span>
                <!--v-if-->
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Google's agentic IDE (VS Code-based) — the full neon editor theme.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/antigravity/grimicorn-neon-antigravity.color-theme.json" download="grimicorn-neon-antigravity.color-theme.json" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]" style="color: #75726b;"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Load it like any VS Code theme — a folder with a package.json in Antigravity's extensions directory — then pick Grimicorn Neon.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://antigravity.google/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5" style="border-color: #1c1c20;">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3h12v10H3z"></path><path d="M3 6h12"></path><path d="M5.5 4.5h.01"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold" style="color: #e7e5e4;">Cursor</span>
                <!--v-if-->
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]" style="color: #a7a39c;">AI-first VS Code fork — the same neon editor + workbench theme.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/cursor/grimicorn-neon-cursor.color-theme.json" download="grimicorn-neon-cursor.color-theme.json" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]" style="color: #75726b;"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Drop the file into a folder with a package.json under <code>~/.cursor/extensions/grimicorn-neon/</code>, reload, then pick Grimicorn Neon in <code>⌘K ⌘T</code>.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://docs.cursor.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5" style="border-color: #1c1c20;">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 2.5l5 2.8v5.4L9 13.5 4 10.7V5.3z" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="1.7"></circle></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold" style="color: #e7e5e4;">Devin</span>
                <!--v-if-->
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Cognition's AI engineer — neon for its VS Code-based workspace editor.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/devin/grimicorn-neon-devin.color-theme.json" download="grimicorn-neon-devin.color-theme.json" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]" style="color: #75726b;"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Devin's workspace runs a VS Code editor — load it as a VS Code color theme, then select Grimicorn Neon.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://docs.devin.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
