          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Native Terminal.app profile.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/terminal/Grimicorn-Neon.terminal" download="Grimicorn Neon.terminal" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]" style="color: #75726b;"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Double-click the file (or Settings → Profiles → ⚙︎ → <em>Import</em>), then set as default.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://support.apple.com/guide/terminal/change-profiles-color-trml1067/mac" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5" style="border-color: #1c1c20;">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6.5 6L3.5 9l3 3" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M11.5 6l3 3-3 3" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M10 4.5l-2 9"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold" style="color: #e7e5e4;">Shiki</span>
                <!--v-if-->
              </div>
            </div>
