          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]" style="color: #a7a39c;">TextMate theme for any Shiki-based site — neon syntax on near-black.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/shiki/grimicorn-neon.tmTheme" download="grimicorn-neon.tmTheme" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]" style="color: #75726b;"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Parse the <code>.tmTheme</code> with a plist reader and pass the object to Shiki's <code>theme</code> option (VitePress, Astro, etc.).</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://shiki.style/guide/load-theme" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5" style="border-color: #1c1c20;">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3h12v10H3z"></path><path d="M5.5 6.5l2 2-2 2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9 10.5h3"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold" style="color: #e7e5e4;">tmux</span>
                <!--v-if-->
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Status-line theme — session pill, window tabs, pane borders &amp; copy mode.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/tmux/grimicorn-neon-tmux.conf" download="grimicorn-neon-tmux.conf" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]" style="color: #75726b;"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Add <code>source-file ~/path/grimicorn-neon-tmux.conf</code> to your <code>.tmux.conf</code>, then reload with <code>tmux source-file ~/.tmux.conf</code>.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://man.openbsd.org/tmux#STYLES" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5" style="border-color: #1c1c20;">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3h12v10H3z"></path><path d="M5.5 6.5l2 2-2 2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9 10.5h3"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold" style="color: #e7e5e4;">Warp</span>
                <!--v-if-->
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]" style="color: #a7a39c;">YAML theme — accent, background &amp; the full 16-color ANSI set.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/warp/grimicorn-neon.yaml" download="grimicorn-neon.yaml" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]" style="color: #75726b;"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]" style="color: #a7a39c;">Copy the file into <code>~/.warp/themes/</code>, then Settings → Appearance → Themes → <em>Grimicorn Neon</em>.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://docs.warp.dev/terminal/appearance/custom-themes" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>"
`;

exports[`GrimicornNeonThemesView > swatch copy feedback styling > applies the copy-failed styling hook after a rejected copy 1`] = `"<span data-v-c47154f1="" class="copy-hex font-mono text-[0.62rem] copy-failed-flash" style="color: #2323FF;">couldn't copy</span>"`;

exports[`GrimicornNeonThemesView > swatch copy feedback styling > has no flash classes while idle 1`] = `"<span data-v-c47154f1="" class="copy-hex font-mono text-[0.62rem]" style="color: #2323FF;">#2323FF</span>"`;

exports[`GrimicornNeonThemesView > swatch copy feedback styling > shows the copied label without the failure hook after a successful copy 1`] = `"<span data-v-c47154f1="" class="copy-hex font-mono text-[0.62rem]" style="color: #2323FF;">copied!</span>"`;
